AXIOM Native Fabric G11
Author: Alexandru Moraru
Release date: 2026-11-10

This distribution contains first-party sources and generated artifacts. GNU
build tools, Python, Graphviz, OpenSSL and the host libc are external build,
verification or runtime dependencies; their sources/binaries are not vendored.
The linked system library dependency is disclosed in docs/DEPENDENCIES.md.
The package-verification public key establishes consistency of this snapshot,
not a separately authenticated author identity.

The selected historical SNN/quantum reference files in tests/reference/closed_routine/
retain their original license, notices, filenames and SHA-256 provenance. They
are used only by compatibility tests; their parent framework is not vendored.
